{
  "name": "02 - Camera Behavior - Setup Agent",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": {
          "config": {
            "name": "Setup Notes",
            "parameters": {
              "content": "# Setup Agent\n- Input: user goal summary, building context, optional role/constraints/prior summary\n- Output: `study_plan`, `task_graph`, `graph_plan`, `needfinding_request`, `behavior_monitoring_request_template`, `actionable_insights_request`\n- This workflow plans only, then hands the package to the Study Orchestrator.\n\n# Test Case\n{ \"study_goal\": \"Find congestion in the east lobby\", \"space_type\": \"office lobby\", \"target_area\": \"east lobby\", \"study_duration\": \"2 weeks\", \"desired_output_type\": \"hotspot charts and recommendations\", \"building_id\": \"bldg_001\" }\n\n# Study-State Model\n- draft -> planned -> needfinding_running -> needfinding_complete -> monitoring_running -> milestone_review -> monitoring_complete -> insights_running -> complete\n- failed is terminal unless manually retried.",
              "height": 320,
              "width": 780,
              "color": 4
            },
            "position": [
              3424,
              928
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "5fbb890d-4e0e-4d5b-9400-563ede1e1f98",
      "name": "Sticky Note 02173bab",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
